# 卡比 iOS 的本机配置样例。复制成 kirby/ios/local.env（不进仓）再填。
# Sample local config for Kirby iOS. Copy to kirby/ios/local.env (not committed) and fill in.

# 开发者团队号：Xcode → Settings → Accounts 里选中账号，团队的 Team ID。不填 = 只做不签名构建（能验证编译链接，不能装机）
# Developer Team ID: Xcode → Settings → Accounts, the team's Team ID. Empty = unsigned build only (checks compile/link, cannot install)
KIRBY_TEAM_ID=
# App 包名，自己起，反域名写法，如 com.yourname.kirbyhost
# App bundle ID of your own choosing, reverse-DNS, e.g. com.yourname.kirbyhost
KIRBY_BUNDLE_ID=
# 手机的 devicectl 设备标识：xcrun devicectl list devices 的 Identifier 列
# The phone's devicectl identifier: the Identifier column of xcrun devicectl list devices
KIRBY_DEVICE=
# 免费 Apple ID（个人团队）填 1：不带「提高内存上限」「扩展虚拟寻址」两项权限（签不了）。另有苹果的限制：7 天过期要重装、每台最多 3 个 App。
# 第一次打开前到手机「设置 → 通用 → VPN 与设备管理」里信任开发者。付费账号留空。
# Set to 1 for a free Apple ID (personal team): leaves out the two memory entitlements (cannot be signed). Apple's limits apply: expires in 7 days, at most 3 apps per device.
# Before the first launch, trust the developer under Settings → General → VPN & Device Management. Leave empty for a paid account.
KIRBY_FREE_ACCOUNT=
# 工作区（游戏文件和大产物，不进 git）。缺省 ~/kirby-work，里面放 patched/、shlib/、RomFS/（从 Windows 的 D:\kirby-work 拷来）
# Work area (game files and big outputs, not in git). Default ~/kirby-work, holding patched/, shlib/, RomFS/ (copied from D:\kirby-work on Windows)
KIRBY_WORK=
